    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Two Aga Khan University faculty members Professor Shaista Masood Khan (Department of Surgery) and Associate Professor Nehal Masood (Department of Oncology and Department of Medicine) have been conferred the prestigious Sitara-i-Imtiaz (the Star of Excellence) by the President of Pakistan, today, August 14, Pakistan's Independence Day. This high-ranking civilian award has been conferred in recognition of their exemplary services in the field of health for the people of Pakistan.",
